{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53013","headline":"佩赋附歌 · 胡运","name":"佩赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佩玉蘂兮德音发，中规矩兮声不歇。\n驰畋猎兮思敬慎，寿考不亡兮长岁月。\n端法服兮临魏阙，羣后觐兮万方谒。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一一一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡运","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}